{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1206199-hunter-net","id":1206199,"title":"Hunter Net","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-04-12T17:10:52-07:00","id":1206199,"title":"Hunter Net","content":"I'm a little curious about something. In Hunter the Reckoning it is my understanding that the Hunter Net site was hacked. Can anyone point me to where or what book that information came from?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12846-jsavell","name":"JSavell","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12846_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-12T19:02:37-07:00","id":1206227,"title":"","content":"Hunter-net.org was never conventionally hacked IIRC, but there were a few instances of monsters managing to circumvent the Messenger's protections of the system. Carpenter169 was the biggest case of that, but there were at least a few others. The stories of these are generally hard to look for, because they're usually in the H-net post fiction pieces spread throughout the books.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-13T12:06:27-07:00","id":1206563,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1206199-hunter-net?p=1206227#post1206227\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hunter-net.org was never conventionally hacked IIRC, but there were a few instances of monsters managing to circumvent the Messenger's protections of the system. Carpenter169 was the biggest case of that, but there were at least a few others. The stories of these are generally hard to look for, because they're usually in the H-net post fiction pieces spread throughout the books.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, circumventing or being allowed in by the Messengers, if the hunter-net posters' theories in The Walking Dead are right.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-14T03:14:22-07:00","id":1206838,"title":"","content":"There was the major breach in '99. The rest are all minor incidents. There was also a very unfortunate Virtual Adept who hacked in and never came back.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5307-loomer","name":"loomer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5307_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"661"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-16T05:38:53-07:00","id":1207621,"title":"","content":"If I remember right, Carpenter didnt really hack the system so much as manipulated his way into a Hunter circle as a sort of information broker on the supernatural. He would feed them some truths, but was largely aiming them at his enemies or rivals and learned about some of their secrets. But its been a while and I could be wrong.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://t0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcTAO8runv-CR5dodCXgw_8wdJype5yunYCODWdZiBAwUP5WFVv8\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://ksr-ugc.imgix.net/assets/003/593/392/92a29c2836b988505781770a32720148_original.png?v=1428699067&amp;w=700&amp;h=&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format&amp;lossless=true&amp;s=69ffdde357a0cdd88ee89934622443f9\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img692/7017/hh2support.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img703/6636/6kvo.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1721-beckett","name":"Beckett","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1721_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1077"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-29T09:38:17-07:00","id":1213092,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>loomer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1206199-hunter-net?p=1206838#post1206838\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There was the major breach in '99.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, the original hacking occurred in the back of the corebook.<br /> <br /> (Pure conjecture, this hacking probably occurred before Hunter-Net had supernatural protection, which is shown when the aforementioned VA gets burnt).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://darker-days.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Darker Days Radio</a> - The World of Darkness Podcast<br /> <a href=\"http://historylessons.libsyn.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Unbuttoned History</a> - A History Podcast with Jokes","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/124-darker-days-mike","name":"Darker Days Mike","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar124_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"134"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}